# Subtlety (flash, flying): "When this creature enters, choose up to one target creature spell or planeswalker spell. Its
# owner puts it on their choice of the top or bottom of their library." Bot2 casts Llanowar Elves, Bot1 flashes in
# Subtlety with Black Lotus's and an Island's blue mana and targets it; Bot2, its owner, chooses the top. The Elves never resolve and it
# is not countered, so it is on top of Bot2's library and not in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Subtlety
Island x5
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x5
Forest x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Subtlety.Cast
Bot1.Target(Stack.Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Accept
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Library = Llanowar Elves; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Subtlety
